<title>FRANCE: Huge explosion rocks Algiers.</title>
<headline>Huge explosion rocks Algiers.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A powerful blast rocked central Algiers on Sunday evening, residents said.</p>
<p>&quot;We heard a huge explosion 20 minutes ago in the centre of the capital but we do not know yet exactly where,&quot; said one resident speaking by telephone from Algiers. Three days ago a bomb killed 14 people and wounded about 100 in a car market in the town of Boufarik near Algiers.</p>
</text>
